{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37171","headline":"赠进士李德新接海棠梨 · 翁洮","name":"赠进士李德新接海棠梨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蜀人犹说种难成，何事江东见接生。\n席上若微桃李伴，花中堪作牡丹兄。\n高轩日午争浓艳，小径风移旋落英。\n一种呈妍今得地，劒峯梨岭谩纵横。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁洮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37171.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37171","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}